{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>亞太區股市個別發展。</p><p></p><p>日本股市在科技股拖累，指數一度跌逾百分之2，失守64,000點關口，收市跌幅收窄。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市先跌後回升，收市升逾百分之1。</p><p></p><p>台灣股市在權重股拖累，一度下挫百分之2，收市偏軟。</p><p></p><p>澳洲股市在金融及礦業股帶動，收市靠穩。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T09:39:27.757385+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T09:37:46.383701+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:37:46.383701+00:00","content_hash":"90fd10329e29b2b646ad021c87448273150f57128e10f9d29aed2b3bf5a15295","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}